<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);"><font size="5"><b>A proven local partner you can trust.</b></font><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;
mso-themetint:191">The American Red Cross has been a stabilizing force in
communities across the country for over a century, providing disaster relief,
health and safety training, blood collection and other important community
services. We are inviting you to be a part of the local lifesaving network,
bringing hope to people in this community and across the country, when they
need it most. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><i><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;
mso-themecolor:text1;mso-themetint:191;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">&nbsp;</span></i></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;
mso-themetint:191">By taking an active role in our blood program, you’ll help
provide a valuable community service that supports the local and national blood
supply and helps to save the lives of people in your area.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;
mso-themetint:191"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><img src="https://c.na74.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0151J000003WVgi&amp;oid=00Do0000000YrbP" border="0" align="left" alt="" style="font-size: 12pt;"></p><p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">Please call us at&nbsp;</span><font color="#cc0000" face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">{!Lead.OwnerPhone}</span></font><font color="#404040" face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;or visit us at </span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 112, 192); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><a href="http://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-blood-drive/register">redcrossblood.org/hosting-blood-drive</a></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 112, 192); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">
</span><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">to let us know you if are &nbsp;interested. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><i><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;
mso-themecolor:text1;mso-themetint:191;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">P.S.: Participating organizations can receive discounts on
Red Cross health and safety training. Ask me how.</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
